\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {2}{\ignorespaces The two causes of the bottleneck. (a) In the shared pool, idle KV in other slots slows the active request; with a static split it does not. (b) Reserved KV (orange) stays near the pool limit while used KV (blue) is about 36k; at most 4 slots are busy while about 12 tasks wait.}}{2}{figure.caption.2}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{fig:bottleneck}{{2}{2}{The two causes of the bottleneck. (a) In the shared pool, idle KV in other slots slows the active request; with a static split it does not. (b) Reserved KV (orange) stays near the pool limit while used KV (blue) is about 36k; at most 4 slots are busy while about 12 tasks wait}{figure.caption.2}{}}
